mapping "d355.1" source="d355" target="SNOMED_CT:288633005" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source d355 SNOMED CT 288633005 = ICF d355 Discussion: starting, sustaining and ending an
        examination of a topic/examining issues through argument/debate; exchanging views with one or
        more people (a more argumentative/deliberative mode than d350 conversation). Target =, active
        RF2 production, SNOMED CT's direct observable for the conversation/dialogue axis and the nearest
        axis concept. SNOMED CT has NO observable (its concepts are procedures or clinical-content
        situations, not functional abilities); discussion is a mode of conversation, so
        ability-to-make-conversation subsumes it but loses the argumentative/deliberative quality that
        distinguishes discussion from ordinary conversation. Broader (high): direct verified SNOMED CT
        observable match on the conversational-dialogue axis, one-level broader because SNOMED CT captures
        generic conversation ability rather than the discussion-specific mode; mirrors the d320/d335
        one-level-broader precedent where SNOMED CT's axis concept subsumes the source's specific mode.
        mapping_type=broader.
        """
}
