        Broader (low): conversation subsumes the dialogue axis but the source's discussion-mode +
        one-person-modality specificity is outside any SNOMED CT concept (deep climb, no narrower target);
        consistent with the leaf-under-broad-parent precedent (d3351 at).
        mapping_type=broader.
        """
}
